1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,950
Before you scroll today, here are the fourteen stories that matter, from the world to your village, in plain words.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:09,364
Ten stories in depth first, then four quick hits.

3
00:00:09,364 --> 00:00:10,090
Let's begin.

4
00:00:10,540 --> 00:00:11,140
Story one.

5
00:00:11,140 --> 00:00:16,900
The leaders of the United States, China and Russia met together in Shun Jen, China, on Thursday.

6
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:19,515
It was the first sit down of the three.

7
00:00:19,515 --> 00:00:25,010
President Trump met Xi and Putin one on one first, then all three talked for a little over an hour.

8
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:28,180
They released a four point peace declaration.

9
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:36,340
It covers United Nations reform, oil supply, lowering nuclear risk, and a warning that international courts must not abuse their power.

10
00:00:36,790 --> 00:00:40,330
It did not mention the war in Ukraine, or the war with Iran.

11
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:41,789
Who is affected?

12
00:00:41,789 --> 00:00:43,430
Ukraine did not take part.

13
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:46,900
Nor did Germany, France, Britain, Japan or South Korea.

14
00:00:47,350 --> 00:00:48,188
Why it matters:

15
00:00:48,188 --> 00:00:54,721
the United States and Russia each have more than five thousand nuclear warheads, and China has more than six hundred.

16
00:00:54,721 --> 00:00:59,300
The leaders said a nuclear war should never be fought, but they announced no cuts.

17
00:00:59,750 --> 00:01:00,758
What happens next?

18
00:01:00,758 --> 00:01:04,004
They agreed to start a dialogue on reducing nuclear risks.

19
00:01:04,004 --> 00:01:08,370
Mister Trump said he will hold a news conference at the White House on Friday.

20
00:01:08,820 --> 00:01:09,465
Story two.

21
00:01:09,465 --> 00:01:15,920
The top United Nations court has ruled that Myanmar committed genocide against the Ro hin ja people.

22
00:01:16,370 --> 00:01:21,340
The International Court of Justice gave its ruling on Thursday, by nine votes to six.

23
00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:29,070
The judges said soldiers, police and border guards killed around ten thousand Ro hin ja civilians in two thousand seventeen.

24
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:31,953
Hundreds of thousands fled to Bangladesh.

25
00:01:31,953 --> 00:01:35,750
About one point two million Ro hin ja still live in camps there.

26
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:40,368
The case was brought in twenty nineteen by a small country, The Gambia.

27
00:01:40,368 --> 00:01:44,770
Myanmar says its operations were a response to attacks by a militant group.

28
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:46,082
Why it matters:

29
00:01:46,082 --> 00:01:50,510
this is the first time this court has found a state responsible for genocide.

30
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:52,148
What happens next?

31
00:01:52,148 --> 00:01:58,487
The court ordered Myanmar to stop ongoing violations, investigate suspects and give restitution.

32
00:01:58,487 --> 00:02:00,930
Myanmar has two years to report back.

33
00:02:01,380 --> 00:02:02,039
Story three.

34
00:02:02,039 --> 00:02:05,880
The leaders of the Quad met in Manila, in the Philippines, on Tuesday.

35
00:02:06,330 --> 00:02:08,599
The Quad is a group of four countries.

36
00:02:08,599 --> 00:02:14,690
Prime Minister Modi, President Trump, Prime Minister Albanese and Prime Minister Ta kai chi took part.

37
00:02:15,140 --> 00:02:17,260
It was their first summit in two years.

38
00:02:17,260 --> 00:02:21,390
The last one was in Wilmington, in the United States, in twenty twenty four.

39
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:30,440
Mister Modi called the Quad a constructive and trusted partnership, covering sea safety, supply chains, new technology and disaster response.

40
00:02:30,890 --> 00:02:39,890
Mister Trump said the group is launching a Quad A I accelerator, with more than eighty five million dollars to help countries in the Indo Pacific use trusted A I.

41
00:02:40,340 --> 00:02:46,657
He also announced deals to secure critical minerals, so that no single supplier can use them as pressure.

42
00:02:46,657 --> 00:02:47,980
He did not name China.

43
00:02:48,430 --> 00:02:49,403
What happens next?

44
00:02:49,403 --> 00:02:54,810
A first Quad Business Leaders Forum will be held, and more new projects will be announced next year.

45
00:02:55,260 --> 00:02:55,909
Story four.

46
00:02:55,909 --> 00:03:02,870
A gas tanker with Indian sailors on board was attacked in the Strait of Hor mooz on Monday, the sixteenth of November.

47
00:03:03,320 --> 00:03:05,134
The ship is called Tara Gas.

48
00:03:05,134 --> 00:03:09,020
It carries cooking gas, L P G, and flies the flag of Panama.

49
00:03:09,470 --> 00:03:11,628
Twenty four Indians were on board.

50
00:03:11,628 --> 00:03:15,120
Twenty one were taken ashore safely at Khasab, in Oman.

51
00:03:15,120 --> 00:03:16,898
Two are injured in hospital.

52
00:03:16,898 --> 00:03:17,850
One is missing.

53
00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:20,953
India's foreign ministry condemned the attack.

54
00:03:20,953 --> 00:03:25,510
It said attacks on commercial ships must end and free sailing must be restored.

55
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:26,816
Why it matters:

56
00:03:26,816 --> 00:03:30,695
this is the second attack in a week on a tanker with Indian sailors.

57
00:03:30,695 --> 00:03:36,800
On the eleventh, another tanker was hit off the United Arab Emirates, and all twenty two crew were rescued.

58
00:03:37,250 --> 00:03:41,880
The strait carried about one fifth of the world's crude oil before the conflict with Iran.

59
00:03:42,330 --> 00:03:43,344
What happens next?

60
00:03:43,344 --> 00:03:48,640
The Indian embassy in Oman is working with Omani authorities to search for the missing sailor.

61
00:03:49,090 --> 00:03:49,774
Story five.

62
00:03:49,774 --> 00:03:54,128
A big coal company is selling shares to the public for the first time.

63
00:03:54,128 --> 00:03:56,180
It is called Mahanadi Coalfields.

64
00:03:56,630 --> 00:04:04,180
An I P O, or initial public offer, is when a company sells its shares to the public so it can be listed on the stock exchange.

65
00:04:04,630 --> 00:04:07,034
Mahanadi is fully owned by Coal India.

66
00:04:07,034 --> 00:04:11,780
It runs seventeen mines in Odisha, fourteen open pit and three underground.

67
00:04:12,230 --> 00:04:17,293
The price band is one hundred and twenty nine to one hundred and thirty six rupees a share.

68
00:04:17,293 --> 00:04:21,800
The issue is worth about eight thousand nine hundred and eighty one crore rupees.

69
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,080
A crore is ten million.

70
00:04:23,530 --> 00:04:26,050
All the shares are being sold by Coal India.

71
00:04:26,050 --> 00:04:28,970
So the company itself gets no money from this sale.

72
00:04:29,420 --> 00:04:37,720
In the last financial year, the company's profit after tax was about ten thousand six hundred and ninety eight crore rupees, down one percent.

73
00:04:38,170 --> 00:04:40,935
Bidding closes on the twenty third of November.

74
00:04:40,935 --> 00:04:43,405
Listing is expected on the twenty seventh.

75
00:04:43,405 --> 00:04:45,170
This is not investment advice.

76
00:04:45,620 --> 00:04:46,221
Story six.

77
00:04:46,221 --> 00:04:49,769
Cyclone Ack van is heading for the coast of Andhra Pradesh.

78
00:04:49,769 --> 00:04:55,240
The weather department expects it to cross the coast on Friday, the twentieth, around noon.

79
00:04:55,690 --> 00:05:00,790
It is expected to cross between Nell ore and Too nee, as a very severe cyclonic storm.

80
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:09,050
Winds of one hundred and twenty to one hundred and thirty kilometres an hour are expected, with gusts up to one hundred and forty five.

81
00:05:09,500 --> 00:05:16,860
Extremely heavy rain, more than twenty one centimetres in a day, is forecast for north coastal Andhra on the nineteenth and twentieth.

82
00:05:17,310 --> 00:05:18,301
Who is affected?

83
00:05:18,301 --> 00:05:21,523
Coastal Andhra Pradesh, south Odisha and Tamil Nadu.

84
00:05:21,523 --> 00:05:27,780
Fishermen have been asked not to go to sea, and Odisha has begun moving people from vulnerable areas.

85
00:05:28,230 --> 00:05:29,099
Why it matters:

86
00:05:29,099 --> 00:05:31,590
this is the third cyclone in under a month.

87
00:05:31,590 --> 00:05:37,790
Andhra Pradesh says two earlier storms have already caused losses of more than seven thousand crore rupees.

88
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,334
What happens next?

89
00:05:39,334 --> 00:05:42,678
Officials will track the storm as it crosses the coast.

90
00:05:42,678 --> 00:05:45,900
Rain is also forecast for Odisha on the twenty first.

91
00:05:46,350 --> 00:05:47,051
Story seven.

92
00:05:47,051 --> 00:05:53,710
Uttar Pradesh has published its draft list of voters, ahead of the state assembly election in twenty twenty seven.

93
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:57,124
The list has thirteen point five eight crore voters.

94
00:05:57,124 --> 00:06:00,773
That is about eighteen point eight four lakh more than in April.

95
00:06:00,773 --> 00:06:02,540
A lakh is one hundred thousand.

96
00:06:02,990 --> 00:06:10,670
There are seven point three eight crore men, six point two zero crore women, and four thousand and forty two voters of the third gender.

97
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:15,090
Eleven point eight three lakh voters are aged eighteen to nineteen.

98
00:06:15,540 --> 00:06:16,397
Why it matters:

99
00:06:16,397 --> 00:06:23,194
the election officer says about sixteen crore people in the state are eighteen or older, based on population estimates.

100
00:06:23,194 --> 00:06:27,250
So the list is about two point five eight crore short of that estimate.

101
00:06:27,700 --> 00:06:28,738
What happens next?

102
00:06:28,738 --> 00:06:34,504
People can file claims and objections from the seventeenth of November to the sixteenth of December.

103
00:06:34,504 --> 00:06:40,097
Special camps run on the twenty first, twenty second, twenty eighth and twenty ninth of November.

104
00:06:40,097 --> 00:06:42,980
The final list comes out on the fourth of January.

105
00:06:43,430 --> 00:06:44,079
Story eight.

106
00:06:44,079 --> 00:06:48,510
Ladakh will vote on the fourth of December to elect its hill development councils.

107
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:54,120
Newly set up councils will cover all eight districts of Ladakh, with one hundred seats in all.

108
00:06:54,570 --> 00:06:58,410
Thirty six of the hundred seats are reserved for women, for the first time.

109
00:06:58,860 --> 00:07:01,105
Nominations closed on the seventeenth.

110
00:07:01,105 --> 00:07:04,060
Today, the twentieth, is the last day to withdraw.

111
00:07:04,510 --> 00:07:05,742
Not everyone agrees.

112
00:07:05,742 --> 00:07:13,504
Earlier this month Kargil saw a full shutdown, called by the Kargil Democratic Alliance, over timing and how seats were drawn.

113
00:07:13,504 --> 00:07:18,740
In Leh, the Apex Body asked to delay the vote to April or May because of winter snow.

114
00:07:19,190 --> 00:07:20,151
What happens next?

115
00:07:20,151 --> 00:07:24,740
Voting is on the fourth of December, and the whole process is to finish by the eighth.

116
00:07:25,190 --> 00:07:25,841
Story nine.

117
00:07:25,841 --> 00:07:31,700
In Maharashtra, farmers hit by drought are getting an advance payment of five thousand rupees each.

118
00:07:32,150 --> 00:07:37,234
Chief Minister Devendra Fadnavis announced it on the fourteenth of October, before Diwali.

119
00:07:37,234 --> 00:07:40,510
Drought has been declared in around three hundred talukas.

120
00:07:40,960 --> 00:07:48,400
The government estimated the cost at six thousand crore rupees, reaching about one crore ten lakh to one crore twenty lakh farmers.

121
00:07:48,850 --> 00:07:53,512
Mister Fadnavis called it unprecedented, and said it cannot cover all losses.

122
00:07:53,512 --> 00:07:58,840
Each eligible farmer gets at least five thousand rupees now, and the rest is paid later.

123
00:07:59,290 --> 00:08:03,540
Opposition parties and farmers have criticised the amount as too small.

124
00:08:03,540 --> 00:08:07,910
A loan waiver for another three and a half lakh farmers is also to begin.

125
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:09,309
What happens next?

126
00:08:09,309 --> 00:08:13,950
The reports we checked, from October, do not say whether every farmer has been paid yet.

127
00:08:14,400 --> 00:08:14,977
Story ten.

128
00:08:14,977 --> 00:08:20,920
The Union government has approved more than three hundred and fifty crore rupees for farming in Punjab.

129
00:08:21,370 --> 00:08:30,400
Agriculture Minister Shivraj Singh Chouhan handed over the approval letters at Badarpur village, in Mo ha lee district, on Tuesday, the seventeenth.

130
00:08:30,850 --> 00:08:37,819
Two hundred and fifty four point two zero crore rupees is for this year under a scheme called P M R K V Y.

131
00:08:37,819 --> 00:08:41,830
Ninety eight point four four crore is for seven new projects.

132
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:46,872
The event was part of the Khet Bachao Abhiyan, or Save the Field campaign.

133
00:08:46,872 --> 00:08:51,030
Mister Chouhan spoke about crop residue and new farming technology.

134
00:08:51,480 --> 00:09:01,510
Green ammonia, made with solar power, is being tried in place of urea on ten thousand hectares across the country, including one thousand and eight hectares in Punjab.

135
00:09:01,960 --> 00:09:06,800
Mister Chouhan said the only aim is to improve the lives of the farmers of Punjab.

136
00:09:07,250 --> 00:09:08,072
Quick hit one.

137
00:09:08,072 --> 00:09:14,651
Voyager One, launched in nineteen seventy seven, reached one light day from Earth on the eighteenth of November.

138
00:09:14,651 --> 00:09:17,470
A radio signal now takes a full day to reach it.

139
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:24,230
It is about twenty five point nine billion kilometres away, the farthest any human made object has gone.

140
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:25,545
Quick hit two.

141
00:09:25,545 --> 00:09:35,240
Amazon says it will invest seven billion dollars more in renewable energy in India by two thousand thirty, on top of four billion dollars already contracted.

142
00:09:35,690 --> 00:09:42,610
Four new projects add up to nine hundred and thirty four megawatts, in Karnataka, Madhya Pradesh and Rajasthan.

143
00:09:43,060 --> 00:09:43,979
Quick hit three.

144
00:09:43,979 --> 00:09:53,740
South Korea's top court on Thursday overturned the conviction of former prime minister Han Dook soo for helping with the martial law order of December twenty twenty four.

145
00:09:54,190 --> 00:09:59,360
His fifteen year sentence was overturned, and the case now goes back to the Seoul High Court.

146
00:09:59,810 --> 00:10:00,714
Quick hit four.

147
00:10:00,714 --> 00:10:06,017
Fiji has declared a nationwide state of disaster because of a drought linked to El Nino.

148
00:10:06,017 --> 00:10:08,850
It lasts up to thirty days and can be extended.

149
00:10:09,300 --> 00:10:14,980
More than two million litres of emergency water were delivered to island communities in the past month.

150
00:10:15,430 --> 00:10:18,604
That was Trendsplain Daily for the twentieth of November.

151
00:10:18,604 --> 00:10:20,943
Every source is listed in the description.

152
00:10:20,943 --> 00:10:23,170
Subscribe, and we will see you tomorrow.
